    "chunk_text": "1A - G 30691 - 12 (2019/08\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nPILGRIMAGES ORDINANCE\n\nREGULATIONS made by the Minister of Internal and Home Affairs and Provincial Councils and Local Government in termsof Section 2 of Pilgrimages Ordinance. (Chap. 175).\n\nWAJIRA ABEWARDANA,Minister of Internal and Home Affairs andProvincial Councils and Local Government.\n\nMinistry of Internal and Home Affairs and Provincial Councils and Local Government,Independence Square,Colombo 07,08th July, 2019.\n\nREGULATIONS\n\n1.These regulations may be cited as the regulation of Esala Perahera of Sri Natha Dewala, Weediyagoda RajamahaViharaasthana in the Grama Niladari's Division of No. 606, Godigamuwa Western, Divisional Secretary's Divisionof Horana Kaluthara District.\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2135$36 - 2019 wf.daia;= ui 06 jeks w`.yrejdod - 2019'08'06No. 2135/36 - TUESDAY, AUGUST 06, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n2 AI fldgi: (I) fPoh - Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'08'06PART 1: SEC. (1) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 06.08.2019\n\n2. In these regulations \u2013\"Camp area\" means the area described in the Schedule,\n\n\"District Secretary/Government Agent\" means the Government Agent of Kalutara Administrative District and it alsoincludes any officer authorized by him in terms of regulation 4,\"Medical Officer\" means the Health Medical officer in charge of the camp area,\n\n\"Pigrim\" means any person who enters and stays within the camp area for any purpose,\"Police Officer\" includes any Grama Niladhari in charge of the camp area,\n\n\"Public Health Inspector\" means the public health inspector in charge of the camp area."
