    "chunk_text": "1 AIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'08'06PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 06.08.2019\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2135$39 - 2019 wf.daia;= ui 06 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'08'06\n\nNo. 2135/39 - TUESDAY, AUGUST, 06, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)PART IV (A) \u2014 PROVINCIAL COUNCILS\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A PG 4609 \u2014 107 (08/2019)\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nPROVINCIAL COUNCIL NOTIFICATIONS\n\nCENTRAL PROVINCIAL COUNCIL\n\nI, Maithree Gunaratne, Governor of the Central Province, hereby make following regulations by virtue of the powers vested in me bySection 188 (i) m. m. and Section 289 of the Municipal Councils Ordinance (Chapter 252) which should be read with Section 2 of theProvincial Council (Consequential Provisions) Act, No. 12 of 1989. This Order shall be effective from 08th of May, 2019.\n\nREGULATIONS\n\nThe special allowances payable to the Mayor Deputy Mayor and a Member of the Dambulla Municipal Council of the Central Provincefor participating in monthly standing committees, sub committees, advisory committees and special general meetings from the DambullaMunicipal Council fund. These allowances shall be in addition to the regulations published in the Extraordinary Gazette No. 1914/40 of15.05.2015 of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka.\n\nFor Special General Meeting-Rs.2,000.00\n\nFor Standing Committee-Rs.750.00\n\nFor Sub Committee or Advisory Committee-Rs.500.00\n\nMAITHREE GUNARATNE,\n\nHon. Governor,Central Province.At Governor\u2019s Office,On this 22nd day of April, 2019.\n\n08 - 798\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
  },
