    "chunk_text": "01. These regulations may be cited as Regulations for payment of Fuel and Telephone Allowances for Members of Pradeshiya\n\nSabhas.\n\n02. These allowances shall be in addition to the regulations published in the Extraordinary Gazette No. 1914/40 of 15.05.2015 of\n\nIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'08'06PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 06.08.20192 A\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nPayment of Fuel Allowance and Telephone allowance for Members of Local Covernment Institutions with low income.\n\nBy considering the condition of the Pradeshiya Sabha fund, a monthly Telephone allowance of Rs. 1,500, by increasing the currentamount of Rs. 1,000 by another Rs. 500, can be paid on a decision made by the Sabha on the basis of incurring of provisions for followingLocal Government Institutions with low income.\n\nBy considering the condition of the Pradeshiya Sabha fund, a monthly Fuel allowance of Rs. 3,000, by increasing the current amountof Rs. 2,500 by another Rs. 500, can be paid on a decision made by the Sabha.\n\n1.Medadumbara Pradeshiya Sabha2.Udapalatha Pradeshiya Sabha3.Kotmale Pradeshiya Sabha4.Matale Pradeshiya Sabha5.Walapane Pradeshiya Sabha6.Ganga Ihala Korale Pradeshiya Sabha7.Pasbage Korale Pradeshiya Sabha8.Pallepola Pradeshiya Sabha9.Wilgamuwa Pradeshiya Sabha10.Thumpane Pradeshiya Sabha11.Hanguranketha Pradeshiya Sabha12.Naula Pradeshiya Sabha13.Pujapitiya Pradeshiya Sabha14.Minipe Pradeshiya Sabha15.Yatawatta Pradeshiya Sabha16.Panvila Pradeshiya Sabha17.Laggala Pallegama Pradeshiya Sabha18.Udadumbara Pradeshiya Sabha19.Ambanganga Korale Pradeshiya Sabha20.Norwood Pradeshiya Sabha21.Maskeliya Pradeshiya Sabha22.Agarapathana Pradeshiya Sabha23.Ambagamuwa Pradeshiya Sabha\n\nPayment of Fuel Allowance and Telephone allowance for Members of Local Covernment Institutions with satisfactory income."
