    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2135/59 - 2019 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u0ddd\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dc3 08 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db6\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0db4\u0dad\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dca\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.08.08\n\nNo. 2135/59 \u2013 THURSDAY AUGUST, 08, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE ANNUAL FEAST OF THE OUR LADY\u2019S RAGAMA LANKA BASILLICA CHURCH 2019 Gampaha District IT is announced for the general public to inform that, The Annual Feast of the Ragama Thewatta Lanka Basillika Church 2019 (Feast of the Patients) will be held on 25th of August in 2019 and from 18.08.2019 to 27.08.2019 as the duration of the Annual Feast. 1. This will be brought to the attention of the general public on the regulations published in Gazette No. 1953/43 dated 12th February 2016 under the Pilgrimages Ordinance. 2. These publicity \u2013issued laws will be valid during the period of this ceremony. SUNIL JAYALATH District Secretary / Government Agent, Gampaha. 07th of August 2019,\n\nAt District Secretariat Gampaha.\n\n8-842\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority) PART I: SECTION (1) - GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\n1A G 30706 - 12 (2019/08)\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
