    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'08'09PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 09.08.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 33\n\nMy No.: GCF/ATH/CB/22/LR.Land Ministry\u2019s Ref. No.: 03/J 91/LRB/133.\n\nThe General Public is hereby notified that the compensationpayments in respect of allotment of land described in the Schedulebelow of which the titles were not proved and depicted under LotNos. 01, 04 and 05 in Preliminary Plan No. 7775 prepared by theSurveyor-General that has been vested in the Government throughProviso 38(a) No. 100 of 1993 published in the Gazette ExtraOrdinary Notification No. 775/3 dated 12.07.1993 under GreaterColombo Flood Control and Environment Improvement Project,have been deposited in the District Court, Nugegoda in terms ofSection 33 of the Land Acquisition Act.\n\nThe General Public is hereby informed that any claimant to theallotment mentioned below could obtain the compensation payablefor the allotment after submitting necessary documents to the DistrictCourt, Colombo to prove their ownership.\n\nC. W. Abeysuriya,Acquiring Officer.\n\nGreater Colombo Flood Control andEnvironment Improvement Project,Acquisition Office, No. 03,Sri Jayawardenapura Mawatha, Welikada, Rajagiriya.07th August 2019.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n1. Province:Western2. District:Colombo3. Divisional Secretariat:Colombo4. Village:Bloemandhal5. Name of the Land:Part of land bearing Assmt.No. 579/2 at SirimavoBandaranaike Mawatha6. Preliminary Plan No.:77757. Lot Nos.:01, 04 and 05 of which the titlewas not proved8. Extent:213.58 perches9. District Court:Colombo10. Case No.:DLA 135/1811. Amount Deposited:Rs. 21,568,374.60(Rupees Twenty one million fivehundred and sixty eightthousand three hundred andseventy four and sixty centsonly)\n\n08 \u2013 902\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m