    "chunk_text": "Ministry of Power, Energy and Business Development,No. 72, Ananda Kumaraswami Mawatha,Colombo 07,07th August, 2019.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A G 30715\u2014 67 (08/2019)\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nENERGY DEVELOPMENT AREAS - SOLAR POWER\n\nBATTICALOA DISTRICT\n\nAll the areas of lands situated within the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Divisions specified in Column I together with the body ofwater adjacent, and demarcated by the co-ordinates specified in the corresponding Column II contining an extent specifiedin Hectares in the corresponding Column III.\n\nItem No.Column IColumn IIColumn III\n\n280667 E, 308019 N280038 E, 309284 N01.Koralai Pattu280667 E, 309374 N80.00North281211 E, 308232 N\n\n08 - 957/1\n\nSRI LANKA SUSTAINABLE ENERGY AUTHORITY ACT, No. 35 OF 2007\n\nOrder under Sub section (1) of Section 12\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me by Sub Section (1) of Section 12 of Sri Lanka Sustainable Energy Authority Act, No.35 of 2007, I, Ravi Karunanayake, Minister of Power, Energy and Business Development, in consultation with the Ministersin Ministry of Mahaweli Development and Environment, Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock Development, Irrigation andFisheries & Aquatic Resources Development, Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms, Ministry of PublicAdministraion, Disaster Management & Rural Economic Affairs, Ministry of Internal & Home Affairs and ProvincialCouncils & Local Government, Ministry of City Planning, Water Supply & Higher Education, Ministry of TourismDevelopment, Wildlife and Christian Religious Affairs, Ministry of Megapolis & Western Development and the relevantMinistries of Uva Provincial Council to whom the subject of Environment is assigned, do by this Order declare the areasof lands described in the Schedule hereto as Energy Development Areas in the Monaragala District for the purpose of theaforesaid Act.\n\nRAVI KARUNANAYAKE,Minister of Power, Energy and Business Development."
