    "chunk_text": "wxl 2136$9 - 2019 wf.daia;= ui 13 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'08'13No. 2136/9 \u2013 TUESDAY, AUGUST 13, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lkG 30723 - 32 (08/2019)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref.No.: 4/3/2/M/A/Ma/I.Ba.Ministry of Land and Parliamentary ReformsReference No.: 4-3/7/2017/HW/193.\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, No.28 of 1964, that the Governmentintends to acquire the following land/Servitude which isrequired for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land or Servitude to be Acquired:\n\nThe allotments of Land, containing in extent of 12.6416Hectares, Lots 101 - 151 (50 lots) under mentioned land shownin the Surveyor General\u2019s FVP No. 342 dated on 07.12.2018,Suppliment No.5, Sheet No.5, situated in the village of IhalaBambawa in the Grama Niladhari Division of Ihala Bambawa(E 432 D), in minor division Kandapalla Korale in GalewelaDivisional Secretary\u2019s Division in Matale District of CentralProvince.\n\n1. Lot No. 101Name of the Land: \u2013; Description of Land: PradeshiyaSabha Road; Claimant: Government; Original Claimants:Asgiriya Rajamaha Viharaya; Extent: 0.0373 Hectare.\n\n2. Lot No. 102Name of the Land: Doraketiwalayaya or Bambawegama;Description of Land: Garden; Claimant: Government; OriginalClaimants: Asgiriya Rajamaha Viharaya; Extent: 0.0263Hectare.\n\n3. Lot No. 103Name of the Land: Doraketiwalayaya or Bambawegama;Description of Land: Garden; Claimant: Government; OriginalClaimants: Asgiriya Rajamaha Viharaya,Cultivated by R. M.M. Y. Maduranga; Extent: 0.1963 Hectare."
