    "chunk_text": "wxl 2136$10 - 2019 wf.daia;= ui 13 jeks w`.yrejdod - 2019'08'13No. 2136/10 \u2013 TUESDAY, AUGUST 13, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\n1A - G 30724 - 32 (2019/08)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref.No.: 4/3/2/M/A/Ma/I. Ba.Ministry of Land and Parliamentary ReformsReference No.: 4-3/7/2017/HW/161.\n\nI, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, No.28 of 1964, that the Governmentintends to acquire the following land/Servitude which isrequired for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land or Servitude to be Acquired :\n\nThe allotments of Land, containing in extent of 8.4542Hectares, Lots 242 - 335 (88 lots) under mentioned land shownin the Surveyor General\u2019s F.V.P No. 342 dated on 10.04.2019,Supplement No.10, Sheet No.10, situated in the Village ofBambawa in the Grama Niladhari Division of Ihala Bambawa(E 432 D), in Galewela Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division in MataleDistrict of Central Province.\n\n1. Lot No. 242Name of the Land: Nikapallama, Bogahamulehena,Bogahamulakelehena; Description of Land: Estate; Claimant:\n\nGovernment; Original Claimants: Encroachment byJayalathge Priyanka Pushpa Kumari Jayarathne; Extent:0.0018 Hectare.\n\n2. Lot No. 243Name of the Land: Kalugala Ela; Description of Land:Canal; Claimant: Government; Extent: 0.0478 Hectare.\n\n3. Lot No. 244Name of the Land: Nikapallama, Bogahamulehena,Bogahamulakelehena; Description of Land: Estate; Claimant:Government; Original Claimants: Encroachment by JayalathgePriyanka Pushpa Kumari Jayarathne; Extent: 0.0003 Hectare.\n\n4. Lot No. 245Name of the Land: Nikapallama, Bogahamulehena,Bogahamulakelehena; Description of Land: Estate; Claimant:Government; Original Claimants: Encroachment byBulathsinhala Arachchilage Damayanthi; Extent:0.0227 Hectare."
