    "chunk_text": "8.Parking of private vehicles in the main street is hereby prohibited and no person shall enter any type of vehiclein to the camp area including bicycles and bullock carts without a permit issues by me or the officer in charge ofthe camp.\n\n10.In view of security reasons, the lease of land on the Mahiyangana - Badulla road from Ridikoteleya Bridge toSangamitharamaya has been suspended during this year due to security reasons.\n\n11.15.Establishing tempory stalls mobile stalls and selling good is entirely prohibited in the area of Infront of thehospital prenises.\n\n12.A11 the temporary constructions in the leased out commercial lands shall comply with the specifications madeby the Department of Health.01 or 02 sanitary toilets adjacent to each boutique will have to be made available for theuse of pilgrims, if ordered, after the removel of the temporary buildings/sheds by the settlers of the leased out landat the end or the festival, old refuse and garbage including polythene shall be collected and disposed under thesupervision of the Public Health Instructors.\n\n13.No person shall without the previous sanction of the Divisional Secretary, construct any booth or any sort ofbuilding or extend any building, so as to encroach on any land used or street for use as a street with in camp areaor on any land forming the banks of the river with in the camp area.\n\n14.It is entirely prohibited providing seats for money to visit perahera.\n\n15.No person shall construct any building within camp area unless a license has been obtained in that behalf fromme.\n\n15th Regulation (Pilgrimages Ordinance)\n\n(a)No person shall, without the previous of the Divisional Secretary, construct any booth or any sort of buildingany extend any building, so as to encroach any land used or set apart for use as a street with in the camp area orany land forming the bank of the river within the camp area.\n\n(b)Firing of any sort of crackers is strictly prohibited with in the camp area."
