    "chunk_text": "wxl 2136$13 - 2019 wf.daia;= ui 13 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'08'13No. 2136/13 \u2013 TUESDAY, AUGUST 13, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lkG 30727 - 37 (08/2019)\n\nLAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 7\n\nMy No.: KOT/LND/ACQVI/01/66.\n\nLand Min. Ref. No. : 4-3/15/2014/VE/286.\n\nI hereby notify under Sub-section 7, of the Land AcquisitionAct, as amended by the land Acquisition (Amendments) ActNo. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire thefollowing land/servitude which is required for public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land or servitude to be Acquired:\n\nAllotments of the land called Field No. 07 of DiyadawaEstate situated at Diyadawa Village of Kotapola/North GramaNiladhari's Divisions of Kotapola Divisional Secretariat ofMatara District in the Southern Province, depicted as Lot No.2338 and Lot No. 2339 of supplementary sheet No. 96 ofSheet No. 124 in F.V.P. 45 prepared by Survey General,containing in extent about 0.5116 Hectare and boundaries ofthe land given below.\n\nLot No. 2338 \u2013 Name of the land: Field No. 07 ofDiyadawa estate; Claimant: Talawakele PlantationCompany Ltd, No. 400, Deens Road, Colombo 10;Extent: About 0.2884 Hectare.\n\nNorth by: Lot No. 103; East by: Road; South by: Road andPuhul Dola; West by: Lot No. 103.\n\nLot No. 2339 \u2013 Name of the land: Field No. 07 of Diyadawaestate; Claimant: Talawakele Plantation Company Ltd,No. 400, Deens Road, Colombo 10; Extent: 0.2232Hectare.\n\nNorth by: Road and Lot No. 103; East by: Lot No. 103 andPuhul Dola; South by: Puhul Dola; West by: Road.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land/servitude is tobe acquired are hereby to appear personally or by agentsduly authorized in writing before me at the DivisionalSecretariat, Kotapola on 30.09.2019 at 10.00 a.m."
