    "chunk_text": "4. Lot No. 4 Name of the land: \u2014; Land use: High-level Road; Claimant of the Land: State, Part of Lot No. 1 in Preliminary Plan No. Co. 9635. Claimed by Mr. M. E. D. William, No. 3, Thotewatta Mawatha, Wewala, Ja-Ela; Extent: 0.0005 Hectare.\n\nG 30738 - 27 (2019/08) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby\n\nacquired to appear personally, or agents duly authorized\n\nin writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat,\n\nMaharagama on the 20th September, 2019, at 9.00 a.m\n\nand are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in\n\nduplicate) on or before the day of 20th September, 2019,\n\nthe nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of\n\ntheir claims for compensation, for the Acquisition of the\n\nsaid land the amount of compensation and the details of\n\nthe computation of such amount.\n\nM. M. K. DILRUKSHI WALPOLA, Divisional Secretary, Maharagama. Divisional Secretariat, Maharagama 15th August, 2019. 8-1052"
