    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'08'19PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA 19.08.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2137$5 - 2019 wf.daia;= ui 19 jeks i\u00f7od - 2019'08'19No. 2137/5 - MONDAY, AUGUST 19, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERALGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n6TH AMENDMENT\n\nService Minute of the Sri Lanka Administrative Service\n\nTHE Service Minute of the Sri Lanka Administrative Service published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1842/2 dated23rd of December 2013 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as amended by the Gazettes ExtraordinaryNo. 1923/47 dated 16th of July 2015, No. 1979/33 dated 11th August 2016, No. 2086/22 dated 30th of August 2018, No. 2095/9dated 30th of October 2018 and No. 2095/48 dated 2nd of November 2018 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka isamended as follows and these amended provisions will be made effective from 26th of February 2019, the date on which theCabinet of Ministers made the policy decision.\n\nBy Order of the Public Service Commission,\n\nM. A. B. DAYA SENARATH,Secretary,Public Service Commission.\n\n07th August, 2019.\n\n13.1.1(a)\n\n(ii) Should have completed at least six (06) years of active and satisfactory period of service in Grade III of thecategory of service and earned six (06) salary increments.\n\n(iii) Should have demonstrated a performance at satisfactory level or above during six (06) years immediatelypreceding the date of promotion in accordance with the approved procedure or performance appraisal.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A G 30741 \u2014 22 (08/2019)"
