    "chunk_text": "(vi) Should have demonstrated a performance at satisfactory level or above during six (06) years immediatelypreceding the date of promotion in accordance with the approved procedure or performance appraisal.\n\n10.2.1.1\n\n(iv) Should have demonstrated a performance at satisfactory level or above during six (06) years immediatelypreceding the date of promotion in accordance with the approved procedure of performance appraisal.\n\nThe following note will be included below the qualifications referred to under 10.2.1.1\n\nNote\n\nThe officers who are to be promoted to Grade II and have completed the qualifications referred to in the amended10.1.1.1 as at 26th of February 2019, the date on which the Cabinet of Ministers made the policy decision and theofficers who were promoted to Grade II prior to such date will be promoted to Grade I from the date theycomplete a period of 12 years of active and satisfactory service in Grade III and II and all other qualificationsreferred to under 10.2.1.1 excluding the qualification in 10.2.1.1(i).\n\n09-167\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
