    "chunk_text": "(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u000f \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0013 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0016 \u0db4\u0018\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0002 \u0004\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nPART III - LANDS\n\nTitle Registration\n\nREGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, No. 21 OF 1998\n\nDeclaration of Determination of the Commissioner of Title Settlement under Section 14\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby de-clare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land Nos. 236, 241 and 243 of Block 03, contained in the Cadastral Map No. 330302, situated in the Village of Ihalagorakaoya within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 460 J- Ihala Gorahaoya in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Kothmale, in the District of Nuwaraeliya, in the Province of Cen-tral, referred to in Notice No. 33/0008 calling for claims to land parcels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 1715/17 of 21st July, 2011 in terms of Section 12 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998. P. M. H. PRIYADHARSHANI, Commissioner of Title Settlement (Covering up Duties) Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 10th July, 2019.\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Extraordinary Gazette can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 030808 - 14 (2019/08)\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2137 / 75 \u2013 2019 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u0013\u0dc3\u0dca\u0016 23 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0019 \u001a\u001b\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf\u001a\u001b\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf\u001a\u001b\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2019.08.23\n\nNo. 2137 / 75 \u2013 FRIDAY, AUGUST 23, 2019\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a \u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \