    "chunk_text": "SURANGA AMBAGAHATENNE,Assistant Registering Officer,Electoral District - No. : 21- Ratnapura.District Elections Office,Ratnapura,23rd August, 2019.\n\n09 -208/21\n\nREGISTRATION OF ELECTORS ACT, No. 44 OF 1980\n\nNotice under Section 13(2)\n\nREVISION OF ELECTORAL REGISTERS 2019\n\nNOTICE is hereby given under Section 13(2) of the Registration of Electors Act, No. 44 of 1980, that\u2013\n\n(1) List \u201cA\u201d containing names of persons in the electoral register who are dead or have become disqualified ; and\n\n(2) List \u201cB\u201d containing the names of persons whose names do not appear in the current electoral register but noweligible to be included in the register.\n\nhave been completed in respect of the above Electoral District and that the register in operation and such lists or portionsthereof are open for inspection of the general public during office hours as follows :\n\nPlaces of ExhibitionRegister and Lists or Portions thereof forExhibition\n\n(i) District Elections OfficeComplete copy of the electoral register in force for the aboveKegalle DistrictElectoral District and copies of the relevant \u201cA\u201d and \u201cB\u201d Lists.\n\n(ii) Each Divisional SecretariatA copy of portion of the electoral register in force containing all PollingDistrict lying within the relevant Divisional Secretary\u2019s area and copies ofthe related \u201cA\u201d and \u201cB\u201d Lists.\n\n(iii) Each Local AuthorityA copy of the electoral register in force containing all Polling Districts lyingwithin the area of authority of the relevant Local Authority and copies ofthe related \u201cA\u201d and \u201cB\u201d Lists.\n\n(iv) Each Grama Niladhari\u2019sA copy of the electoral register in force containing all Polling District lyingOfficewithin the relevant Grama Niladhari\u2019s Division and copies of the related\u201cA\u201d and \u201cB\u201d Lists.\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 201