    "chunk_text": "wxl 2137$87 - 2019 wf.daia;= ui 23 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'08'23\n\nNo. 2137/87 \u2013 FRIDAY, AUGUST 23, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\n1A\n\n1A- PG 4625 - 187 (2019/08)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nLand Ministry Ref. No.: 4-3/6/2017/HW/151.\n\nMy Ref. No.: RDA/LAND/MATT/2017/1.\n\nI hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquirethe following lands which are required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land to be Acquired:\n\nLot No 1 - 112 (Lots 112) allotments of land in Total Extentof about 0.6461 Hectare, in Preliminary Plan No. CO 9750 anddated 15.05.2018 prepared by the Senior - SuperintendentSurveyor of Colombo District on behalf of Surveyor General,situated in the Village of Modara(Division No.4-AluthMawatha, 5-Lunupokuna-within the Colombo MunicipalCouncil limit) in the Grama Niladhari Divisions of AluthMawatha and Lunupokuna - Kotahena West in the DivisionalSecretary\u2019s Division of Colombo in Colombo District in theWestern Province.\n\n01. Lot No. 1Name of land: Cannot be found; Description: Garden;Claimant: State; Original Claimant: - (a part of Aluth Mawathaand St. Jems Street, required for construction of access roadof Mattakkuliya Bridge); Extent: 0.0037 Hectare.\n\n02. Lot No. 2Name of land: Assmt.No.611, Aluth Mawatha; Description:Garden; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: National HousingDevelopment Authority (a part of Lot No.2 in Preliminary PlanNo. CO 7325, to finalise the land acquisition); Extent: 0.0049Hectare."
