    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2137$90 - 2019 wf.daia;= ui 23 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'08'23No. 2137/90 - FRIDAY AUGUST 23, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE MIRIGAMA PRADESHIYASABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Mirigama Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of Resignation ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the People\u2019s Liberation Front, the recognized political party to whichWijalathpedige Nimal Thilakarathna the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaidordinance, to decide upon returned member of People\u2019s Liberation Front who belongs to such party and is not disqualifiedunder Section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within aperiod of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Kamburadeni Dewage Chaminda Lalith Kumara to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Karunasingha Jayarathnage Sampath Madhawa, Returning Officer of the MirigamaPradeshiya Sabha, acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) dohereby declare that Kamburadeni Dewage Chaminda Lalith Kumara was selected as the member of the Mirigama PradeshiyaSabha.\n\nK. J. S. MADHAWA,Returning Officer,Mirigama Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Gampaha,22nd August, 2019.\n\n09 - 244\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
