    "chunk_text": "1A - PG 004629 - 207 (2019/08)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nTHE WAGES BOARDS ORDINANCE\n\nNotification\n\nPre School Service Trade\n\nIT is hereby notified under Section 29(3) read with Section 33(3) of the Wages Boards Ordinance (Chapter 136), that thedetermination relating to the minimum rate of wages in respect of teachers and assistants engaged in the Pre School ServiceTrade specified in the Schedule here to made by the Commissioner of Labour under Section 33(2) of the aforesaid ordinance,in pursuance of the authority conferred on him by an order made by Hon . Minister of Labour and Trade Union Relationsunder Section 33(1)(a) of the Ordinance and Published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1120/3 of 21st February 2000 hasbeen approved by the Hon. Minister of Labour and Trade Union Relations.\n\nThe determination shall come into force on the 01st of September, 2019.\n\nR. P. R. RAJAPAKSA,\n\nSecretary,Ministry of Labour and Trade Union Relations.\n\nMinistry of Labour and Trade Union Relations,Colombo 05,20th August, 2019.\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2138$3 - 2019 wf.daia;= ui 26 jeks i\u00f7od - 2019'08'26\n\nNo. 2138/3 - MONDAY, AUGUST 26, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n2 AI fldgi: (I) fPoh - Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'08'26PART 1: SEC. (1) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 26.08.2019\n\nSCHEDULE"
