    "chunk_text": "3.IMonthly allowance of Rs. 3000.00 can be paid to the Mayor of Municipal Council as refreshmentallowance. The expenditure Head should be submitted for the purpose.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - PG 4587 \u2014 20 (2019/08)\n\n3.IIMonthly allowance of Rs. 750.00 can be paid to the Deputy Mayor of Municipal Council as refreshmentallowance. The Expenditure Head should be submitted for the purpose.\n\n3. IIIFor the Members of Municipal Council participation for meeting of Municipal Council each memberfor each meeting could be spent Rs. 100.00 under Municipal Council Fund.\n\nThe System after the revision\n\n3.IMonthly allowance of Rs. 5000.00 can be paid to the Mayor of Municipal Council as refreshmentallowance. The expenditure Head should be submitted for the purpose.\n\n3.IIMonthly allowance of Rs. 3000.00 can be paid to the Deputy Mayor of Municipal Council asrefreshment allowance. The Expenditure Head should be submitted for the purpose.\n\n3. IIIFor the Members of Municipal Council participation for meeting of Municipal Council each memberfor each meeting could be spent Rs. 200.00 under Municipal Council Fund.\n\n02. Refreshment allowances and refereshment expenses for honourable Chairman and members of PradeshiyaSabha\n\nPresent System\n\n3.IMonthly allowance of Rs. 2000.00 can be paid to the Chairman of Pradeshiya Sabha as refreshmentallowance. The expenditure Head should be submitted for the purpose.\n\n3. IIFor the Members of Pradeshiya Sabha participation for meeting of Pradeshiya Sabha each memberfor each meeting could be spent Rs. 100.00 under Pradeshiya Sabha Fund.\n\nSystem after the revision\n\n3.IMonthly allowances of Rs. 4000.00 can be paid to the Chairman of Pradeshiya Sabha as refreshmentallowance. The expenditure Head should be submitted for the purpose.\n\n3. IIFor the Members of Pradeshiya Sabha participation for meeting of Pradeshiya Sabha each memberfor each meeting could be spent Rs. 200.00 under Pradeshiya Sabha Fund."
