    "chunk_text": "wxl 2138$7 - 2019 wf.daia;= ui 26 jeks i\u00f7od - 2019'08'26\n\nNo. 2138/7 \u2013 MONDAY, AUGUST 26, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nG 30824 - 17 (08/2019)\n\nTHE ACT ACQUIRING LANDS AS AMENDED BY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (AMENDMENT)\n\nNo. 28 OF 1964 (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy No.: BI/E/3/Road-3/Acquisitions.Land Ministry No.: 4/3/7/2011/HW/154.\n\nIT is hereby notified under Section 7(1) of the LandAcquisition Act since the Government intends to acquire thefollowing lands required for the expansion of the Peradeniya- Badulla - Chenkaladi Road.\n\nDescription of the Land to be Acquired:\n\nIn the last map of the village map prepared by the SurveySuperintendent of Monaragala in Bibila in the MonaragalaDistrict of the Uva Province, the Survey Plan of the F.V.P. 573Supplement No. 87 of the Sheet No. 88 is as follows:\n\nTotal Extent of the Hectares 0.0003.\n\n01. Lot No. 1392Name of the Land: \u2013; Claimant: Government; Encroacher:W. L. Nandasiri; Extent: 0.0003 Hectare.\n\nAll persons who claim rights, rights or any other kind ofgrounds of origin are the authorized persons or authorizedpersons of their respective places or may contact the BibilaDivisional Secretariat on the 28th October, 2019.\n\nFurther the nature of their rights and the nature of theirrights before the date of 21st October, 2019 should be notifiedto me by a document with two copies of the particulars of therequest for compensation and the manner of calculatingcompensation and the amount of compensation.\n\nUPEKSHA N. WIJESINGHE,\n\nDivisional Secretary,\n\nBibile.\n\nDivisional Secretariat, Bibile,21st August, 2019.\n\n09 - 285\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
